        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As per the order of the Hon'ble Apex Court in suo-moto Writ Petition Civil No(s). 03 of 2023 IN RE. Cognizance for Extension of Limitation Period vide order dated 23.03.2020 has exercised the power and ordered that the period of limitation "
