        "text_preview": "9. Thus, in this case, maximum period that can be granted was till 07.02.2020 and these appeals have been filed on 01.07.2022, learned Government Advocate for the respondents/State had filed the additional documents in support of these appl"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "28e0b8ead4aa47d793d0586bc4ffb9e0_26",
