        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "If the Officers of the State keep pending the proceedings on that ground they cannot claim that the period under undergone in the process be condoned, whereas the order of the Apex Court in suo-moto Writ Petition Civil No(s)."
      },
      {
