        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As perusal of the appeal shows that it was filed on 13.6.2016 against against the judgment dated 16.12.2015,\nThe State Of Madhya Pradesh vs M/S Dharampal Satyapal Ltd. on 6 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/180663204/\n3"
